/* 场边记分：选规则时顶部概要是重点色块；记分时记分牌是重点色块（同一时间只有一块） */
.muted { color: #70708C; text-align: center; padding-top: 120rpx; }
.field + .field { margin-top: 24rpx; }
.field .label { display: block; margin-bottom: 14rpx; }
.rules-tip { margin-top: 20rpx; font-size: 22rpx; color: #6E6EA3; background: #F1F1F8; border-radius: 12rpx; padding: 12rpx 18rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.note { margin-top: 20rpx; text-align: center; font-size: 22rpx; color: #84849E; }
.gap { margin-top: 20rpx; }

.hero { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20rpx; padding: 28rpx 0 28rpx 32rpx; border-radius: 36rpx; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #A3A3CB, #8484B6); box-shadow: 0 12rpx 28rpx rgba(133, 133, 184, 0.3), inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); overflow: hidden; }
.hero-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.hero-k { font-size: 22rpx; opacity: 0.85; }
.hero-t { margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 36rpx; font-weight: 800; }
.hero-x { margin: 0 10rpx; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0.8; }
.hero-s { margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 24rpx; opacity: 0.92; }
.hero-art { flex: none; width: 150rpx; height: 150rpx; margin: -12rpx 18rpx -12rpx 12rpx; }

.draft { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.draft-t { font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #6E6EA3; }

/* 记分牌 */
.sb { margin-bottom: 24rpx; padding: 26rpx 28rpx 28rpx; border-radius: 36rpx; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #A3A3CB, #8484B6); box-shadow: 0 12rpx 28rpx rgba(133, 133, 184, 0.3), inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); }
.sb-k { font-size: 22rpx; opacity: 0.88; margin-bottom: 14rpx; }
.bd-row { display: flex; align-items: center; height: 92rpx; }
.bd-row.bd-head { height: 36rpx; font-size: 20rpx; opacity: 0.8; }
.bd-row + .bd-row { border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); }
.bd-side { width: 120rpx; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; min-width: 0; }
.bd-sn { flex: 1; min-width: 0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.bd-srv { flex: none; width: 14rpx; height: 14rpx; margin-right: 10rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; }
.bd-srv.on { background: #C9E33A; box-shadow: 0 0 12rpx rgba(201, 227, 58, 0.85); }
.bd-head .bd-side { font-size: 20rpx; }
.bd-g { width: 80rpx; flex: none; text-align: center; font-size: 40rpx; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.7; position: relative; }
.bd-head .bd-g { font-size: 20rpx; font-weight: 400; }
.bd-g.w, .bd-g.cur { opacity: 1; font-weight: 900; }
.bd-tb { position: absolute; top: 4rpx; margin-left: 2rpx; font-size: 20rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.bd-p { flex: 1; text-align: right; }
.bd-p.num { font-size: 60rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
.bd-head .bd-p { font-size: 20rpx; }
.sb-call, .sb-res { margin-top: 16rpx; text-align: center; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.sb-pt { display: inline-block; margin-left: 16rpx; padding: 2rpx 16rpx; border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 23rpx; color: #2E3600; background: #C9E33A; }
.sb-swap {
  margin: 14rpx auto 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 10rpx 16rpx 10rpx 20rpx; border-radius: 18rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #2E3600;
  background: #C9E33A; box-shadow: 0 6rpx 16rpx rgba(48, 56, 0, 0.16);
}
.sb-swap-l { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.sb-swap-dot { width: 12rpx; height: 12rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #4E6600; margin-right: 10rpx; }
.sb-swap-go { padding: 4rpx 16rpx; border-radius: 14rpx; font-size: 21rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #C9E33A; background: #2E3600; }
.sb-tip { margin-top: 10rpx; text-align: center; font-size: 21rpx; opacity: 0.88; }

/* 选规则页赛前准备 + 倒计时条 + 记分工具条 */
.toss-entry { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 22rpx; padding: 18rpx 20rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; background: #F4F4FA; }
.te-m { flex: 1; min-width: 0; margin-right: 14rpx; }
.te-t { font-size: 25rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #4F4F7D; }
.te-v { margin-left: 12rpx; padding: 2rpx 14rpx; border-radius: 14rpx; font-size: 21rpx; background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; }
.te-s { margin-top: 4rpx; font-size: 21rpx; color: #70708C; line-height: 1.45; }
.te-acts { flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; }
.te-btn { margin-left: 10rpx; }

.tmr-card { padding: 22rpx 26rpx; margin-bottom: 20rpx; }
.tmr-card.done { background: #F4F9E1; border-color: rgba(158, 190, 20, 0.34); }
.tmr-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.tmr-l { display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #4F4F7D; }
.tmr-card.done .tmr-l { color: #3A5400; }
.tmr-dot { width: 12rpx; height: 12rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #8484B6; margin-right: 10rpx; }
.tmr-dot.done { background: #6A9000; }
.tmr-time { font-size: 46rpx; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; color: #4F4F7D; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.tmr-card.done .tmr-time { color: #466600; }
.tmr-prog { margin-top: 14rpx; height: 8rpx; border-radius: 4rpx; background: #EAEAF4; overflow: hidden; }
.tmr-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4rpx; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8484B6, #C9E33A); }
.tmr-acts { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 12rpx; }
.tmr-act { margin-left: 14rpx; padding: 6rpx 18rpx; border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #6E6EA3; background: #EFEFF7; }

.srv-bar {
  margin: -8rpx 0 20rpx; padding: 16rpx 18rpx; border-radius: 24rpx;
  background: #fff; border: 1rpx solid rgba(132, 132, 182, 0.14);
}
.srv-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.srv-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 600; color: #4F4F7D; }
.srv-muted { font-weight: 400; color: #84849E; }
.srv-dot { flex: none; width: 14rpx; height: 14rpx; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10rpx; background: #D8D8EA; }
.srv-dot.on { background: #C9E33A; box-shadow: 0 0 8rpx rgba(180, 212, 34, 0.65); }
.srv-btn {
  flex: none; margin-left: 10rpx; padding: 6rpx 18rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; font-size: 21rpx; font-weight: 800;
  color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9898C6, #7C7CAF);
}
.srv-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 14rpx -5rpx -6rpx; }
.srv-chip {
  flex: 1; min-width: 112rpx; margin: 0 5rpx 6rpx; height: 54rpx; line-height: 54rpx; text-align: center;
  border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 21rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #5C5C78; background: #F2F2F8;
}
.srv-chip.on { background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; }

/* 可选技术统计快捷补记条 + 统计卡 */
.tag-bar { padding: 20rpx 24rpx; margin-bottom: 20rpx; }
.tag-hd { font-size: 22rpx; color: #70708C; }
.tag-chips { display: flex; margin: 14rpx -6rpx 0; }
.tag-chip {
  flex: 1; margin: 0 6rpx; height: 60rpx; line-height: 60rpx; text-align: center;
  border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #5C5C76; background: #F3F3F9;
}
.tag-chip.on { background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; font-weight: 800; }

.st-card { padding: 26rpx 28rpx; }
.st-hd { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 16rpx; }
.st-t { font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #2E2E4A; }
.st-sub { font-size: 21rpx; color: #84849E; }
.st-sides { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10rpx; }
.st-sa { color: #6E6EA3; max-width: 210rpx; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.st-sm { font-size: 20rpx; font-weight: 500; color: #84849E; }
.st-sb { color: #5A7A00; max-width: 210rpx; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; text-align: right; }
.mom { position: relative; height: 112rpx; border-radius: 18rpx; background: #F7F7FC; padding: 12rpx 14rpx; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 16rpx; }
.mom-mid { position: absolute; left: 14rpx; right: 14rpx; top: 50%; height: 2rpx; background: #E0E0EE; }
.mom-cols { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; height: 100%; }
.mom-col { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 0 2rpx; }
.mom-up, .mom-dn { flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
.mom-up { align-items: flex-end; }
.mom-dn { align-items: flex-start; }
.mom-bar { width: 72%; max-width: 14rpx; }
.mom-bar.a { border-radius: 4rpx 4rpx 0 0; background: #8E8EC0; }
.mom-bar.b { border-radius: 0 0 4rpx 4rpx; background: #B8D42A; }
.st-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14rpx 0; }
.st-row + .st-row { border-top: 1rpx solid #F0F0F7; }
.st-row:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
.st-v { width: 150rpx; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #4F4F7D; }
.st-v.r { text-align: right; }
.st-l { flex: 1; text-align: center; font-size: 23rpx; color: #70708C; }

/* 常亮大字计分板全屏模式 */
.big-wrap {
  position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 80;
  background: #22223A; color: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  padding: 20rpx 24rpx calc(26rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); box-sizing: border-box;
}
.big-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14rpx; }
.big-rule { font-size: 23rpx; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78); }
.big-exit { padding: 8rpx 22rpx; border-radius: 24rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); }
.big-tmr {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 22rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700;
}
.big-tmr.done { background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; }
.big-tmr-n { font-size: 40rpx; font-weight: 900; }
.big-tmr-x { padding: 4rpx 10rpx; opacity: 0.78; }
.big-half {
  flex: 1; border-radius: 34rpx; padding: 30rpx 34rpx; box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), opacity 0.16s ease;
}
.big-half.a { background: linear-gradient(148deg, #9E9EC8, #7878AC); }
.big-half.b { background: #313152; border: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); }
.big-half.dis { opacity: 0.6; }
.big-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; margin-right: 20rpx; }
.big-name-row { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.big-name { font-size: 40rpx; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.big-pt { margin-left: 14rpx; padding: 2rpx 14rpx; border-radius: 14rpx; font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 800; background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; }
.big-sets { margin-top: 22rpx; display: flex; align-items: baseline; }
.big-g { margin-right: 28rpx; font-size: 54rpx; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.62; }
.big-g.cur { font-size: 72rpx; font-weight: 900; opacity: 1; }
.big-call { flex: none; font-size: 132rpx; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
.big-mid { padding: 14rpx 0; text-align: center; }
.big-mid-t { font-size: 24rpx; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76); font-weight: 600; }
.big-mid-swap { display: inline-block; padding: 6rpx 24rpx; border-radius: 18rpx; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 800; background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; }
.big-foot { display: flex; margin: 16rpx -6rpx 0; }
.big-fbtn {
  flex: 1; margin: 0 6rpx; height: 72rpx; line-height: 72rpx; text-align: center;
  border-radius: 20rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
}
.big-fbtn.dis { opacity: 0.4; }

/* 两个大得分按钮 */
.pts { display: flex; margin: 0 -10rpx 24rpx; }
.pt { flex: 1; margin: 0 10rpx; height: 300rpx; border-radius: 36rpx; background: #fff; border: 3rpx solid #D9D9EC; box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(80, 80, 140, 0.06); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.pt.b { background: #F4F4FA; }
/* 两个大得分键：按下缩小、松手回弹都有过渡 */
.pt { transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), opacity 0.16s ease, box-shadow 0.16s ease; }
.pt.dis { opacity: 0.45; }
.pt-k { font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #4F4F7D; }
.pt-n { margin-top: 12rpx; font-size: 76rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #6E6EA3; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }

.fin { text-align: center; }
.fin-t { font-size: 34rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #4F4F7D; }
.fin-s { margin: 8rpx 0 24rpx; font-size: 26rpx; color: #70708C; }
.fin-n { margin-top: 18rpx; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.6; color: #84849E; text-align: left; }
.fin-rk {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20rpx; padding: 18rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 20rpx; background: #F4F4FA; text-align: left;
}
.fin-rk-m { flex: 1; min-width: 0; margin-right: 16rpx; }
.fin-rk-t { font-size: 25rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #4F4F7D; }
.fin-rk-s { margin-top: 4rpx; font-size: 21rpx; color: #70708C; }
.fin-rk-done {
  margin-top: 18rpx; padding: 14rpx 20rpx; border-radius: 18rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 700;
  color: #385800; background: #EEF7C7;
}

.ops { display: flex; margin: 0 -10rpx; }
.op { flex: 1; margin: 0 10rpx; }

/* 底部弹层（转球拍 + 记入球拍时长共用基底） */
.sheet-mask { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; background: rgba(34, 34, 58, 0.44); z-index: 90; }
.sheet {
  position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 91; background: #fff;
  border-radius: 36rpx 36rpx 0 0; padding: 34rpx 30rpx calc(36rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-shadow: 0 -12rpx 36rpx rgba(48, 46, 96, 0.16);
}
.sheet-t { font-size: 32rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #2E2E4A; text-align: center; }
.sheet-s { margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 23rpx; color: #70708C; text-align: center; }

/* 转球拍底盖 */
.toss-stage { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 34rpx 0 22rpx; }
.toss-cap {
  width: 176rpx; height: 176rpx; border-radius: 44rpx; box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: linear-gradient(148deg, #B2B2D8 0%, #8484B6 55%, #656599 100%);
  border: 6rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  box-shadow: inset 0 6rpx 12rpx rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38), inset 0 -8rpx 16rpx rgba(46, 44, 92, 0.34), 0 16rpx 32rpx rgba(94, 92, 152, 0.32);
  transition: transform 0.24s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}
.toss-cap.flip { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.toss-cap.spinning { animation: ani-spin-cap 0.76s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.25, 1); }
.toss-mark {
  width: 112rpx; height: 112rpx; border-radius: 28rpx; box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 3rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32); background: rgba(46, 44, 92, 0.24);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 68rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #C9E33A; text-shadow: 0 4rpx 10rpx rgba(46, 44, 92, 0.32);
}
.toss-res { text-align: center; font-size: 25rpx; color: #70708C; min-height: 36rpx; }
.toss-res.hi { color: #4F4F7D; font-weight: 800; }
.toss-go { margin-top: 24rpx; }
.toss-pick-t { margin: 26rpx 0 14rpx; text-align: center; font-size: 22rpx; color: #84849E; }
.toss-picks { display: flex; margin: 0 -8rpx; }
.toss-p { flex: 1; margin: 0 8rpx; height: 78rpx; line-height: 72rpx; font-size: 26rpx; }

/* 完赛顺手记入球拍时长 */
.rk-empty { text-align: center; padding: 36rpx 0 12rpx; }
.rk-et { font-size: 25rpx; color: #70708C; margin-bottom: 18rpx; }
.rk-add-btn { display: inline-block; }
.rk-lbl { margin: 24rpx 0 12rpx; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #4F4F7D; }
.rk-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -6rpx; }
.rk-chip {
  margin: 0 6rpx 12rpx; padding: 12rpx 20rpx; border-radius: 18rpx;
  background: #F4F4FA; border: 2rpx solid transparent; display: flex; align-items: center;
}
.rk-chip.on { background: #EFEFF9; border-color: #8484B6; }
.rk-cn { font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #6E6EA3; margin-right: 8rpx; }
.rk-cm { font-size: 23rpx; color: #2E2E4A; }
.rk-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 14rpx; padding: 18rpx 0 12rpx; border-top: 1rpx solid #EFEFF6; }
.rk-in-r { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.rk-in { width: 150rpx; height: 64rpx; text-align: center; background: #F5F5FA; border-radius: 14rpx; font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 800; color: #2E2E4A; }
.rk-ph { color: #B4B4C8; font-weight: 400; font-size: 24rpx; }
.rk-u { margin-left: 10rpx; font-size: 24rpx; color: #70708C; }
.rk-qk { display: flex; margin: 4rpx -6rpx 24rpx; }
.rk-qi { flex: 1; margin: 0 6rpx; height: 60rpx; line-height: 60rpx; text-align: center; border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 600; color: #6E6EA3; background: #F4F4FA; }
.rk-qi.on { background: #C9E33A; color: #2E3600; font-weight: 800; }
.rk-acts { display: flex; margin: 0 -8rpx; }
.rk-a { flex: 1; margin: 0 8rpx; }
